SUMMARY:Autumn Uncorked: trick or treat in the vineyard
DESCRIPTION:Unfortunately THIS EVENT HAS BEEN CANCELED \n\nJoin us for an afternoon that both adults and children can enjoy\, with wagon rides through the vineyard\, wine tasting for adults\, candy for kids\, balloon twisting\, face painting\, yard games\, hot beverages\, food\, and fun! We’ll have live music 1-4pm\, so bring your lawn chairs and blankets for an afternoon of fun on the lawn.\n\nAdvanced tickets required and available online or in the tasting room until 10/15. [Adults $15 / Children $8].\n\nAll children must be accompanied by an adult.Costumes encouraged\, but not required.\nFood truck (Nano Burgers) will be onsite. Wine and beer will be available for purchase. No outside alcohol or pets allowed.\n[Rain date 10/25. No refunds]
URL:https://grandviewwines.com/vineyard-event/autumn-uncorked-trick-or-treat-in-the-vineyard/
LOCATION:Grandview Vineyard\, 1489 Grandview Rd\, Mount Joy\, PA\, 17552\, United States
END:VEVENT
