SUMMARY:Pretty in PINK Ladies Night at grandview
DESCRIPTION:Join us on October 22nd for a Pretty in PINK Ladies Night Out\, celebrating Breast Cancer Awareness month! Wear PINK\, drink PINK\, buy PINK!! Don’t miss this pop-up event with tattoos\, permanent jewelry\, sweet treats\, hair tinsel and MORE…plus PINK wine tasting flights and PINK cocktail specials!\n\nGrab your friends! No admission\n*Fine line Tattoos by Adorned Tattoos*Permanent bracelet or other accessory from L Squared Permanent Jewelry*Hair Tinsel*Sweet Treats by Rise Bake Shoppe*DIY Bag Charm Bar by Twisted EaselAND MORE!\n\nIndividual activity pricing will vary.\n\nTATTOO info:Fine line tattoos will be offered by Adorned Tattoos. You will be able to choose from several different sheets of tattoos.Sign up will be first come first serve the night of the event!
URL:https://grandviewwines.com/vineyard-event/pretty-in-pink-ladies-night-at-grandview-2/
LOCATION:Grandview Vineyard\, 1489 Grandview Rd\, Mount Joy\, PA\, 17552\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://grandviewwines.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Girl-Scout-Cookie-Pairing-3.jpg
END:VEVENT
